2026-11-03T04:16:40.707191+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0319-s001", "text": "I Finland finns ett kommunalt bibliotek eller stadsbibliotek på alla orter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0319-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.370849609375, "generation_seconds": 28.728270899970084, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:17:14.266447+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0319-s002", "text": "Biblioteket är en plats där du kan låna böcker, läsa tidningar, använda datorn, studera eller delta i olika evenemang.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0319-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.288330078125, "generation_seconds": 45.51133444788866, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:17:47.854257+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0319-s003", "text": "Biblioteken är öppna för alla och verksamheten är kostnadsfri.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0319-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.45355224609375, "generation_seconds": 23.461672740988433, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:18:21.442906+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0320-s001", "text": "På biblioteket kan det även finnas sagotimmar och spel för barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0320-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.299041748046875, "generation_seconds": 19.488859615987167, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0321-s001", "text": "I de flesta biblioteken finns en läsesal.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0321-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.7616326530612243, "peak": 0.3709716796875, "generation_seconds": 13.442685551010072, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:18:55.027000+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0321-s002", "text": "Läsesalen är ett tyst rum som passar för läsning eller till exempel tyst läxläsning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0321-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.45050048828125, "generation_seconds": 22.694174385163933, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:19:28.606130+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0322-s001", "text": "Du kan också få handledning i datoranvändningen och på vissa bibliotek ordnas finska språkcaféer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0322-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.324920654296875, "generation_seconds": 24.435276538832113, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0323-s001", "text": "I Finland finns även vetenskapsbibliotek och läroanstalternas bibliotek samt olika slags specialbibliotek.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0323-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.297027587890625, "generation_seconds": 26.352944453945383, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:20:02.198787+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0323-s002", "text": "Användningen av dem kan vara begränsad, men oftast är de öppna för alla.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0323-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.361083984375, "generation_seconds": 18.45098051801324, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:20:35.783576+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0324-s001", "text": "För att låna material behöver du ett bibliotekskort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0324-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.806530612244898, "peak": 0.251922607421875, "generation_seconds": 15.558387991972268, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0324-s002", "text": "Ett sådant får du på biblioteket.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0324-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.274013605442177, "peak": 0.30596923828125, "generation_seconds": 11.079125209013, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0324-s003", "text": "Kom ihåg att ta med ett ID-kort med bild.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0324-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.900952380952381, "peak": 0.290130615234375, "generation_seconds": 13.501889867009595, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:21:09.368122+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0324-s004", "text": "Om du inte har en finländsk personbeteckning, kan du få ett bibliotekskort som är giltigt en bestämd tid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0324-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.26861572265625, "generation_seconds": 31.047605488914996, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:21:42.952086+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0325-s001", "text": "Bibliotekskortet är avgiftsfritt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0325-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.292205810546875, "generation_seconds": 9.685654836008325, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0325-s002", "text": "Om du tappar bort kortet, måste du betala för ett nytt kort.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0325-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.313720703125, "generation_seconds": 16.82253030803986, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:22:16.544516+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0326-s001", "text": "Du kan även låna böcker på bokbussarna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0326-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.3084716796875, "generation_seconds": 15.399543151957914, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0327-s001", "text": "Lånetiden för böckerna är vanligtvis en månad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0327-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.311981201171875, "generation_seconds": 14.79556036600843, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:22:50.123385+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0327-s002", "text": "Kom ihåg att returnera eller förnya dina lån i tid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0327-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.73687074829932, "peak": 0.320037841796875, "generation_seconds": 13.304460118059069, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0327-s003", "text": "För försenade lån måste du betala en förseningsavgift.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0327-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.231719970703125, "generation_seconds": 16.49079310405068, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:23:23.734535+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0327-s004", "text": "Avgiftens storlek beror på hur många böcker som är försenade och hur många dagar de är försenade.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0327-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.270172119140625, "generation_seconds": 29.26350424089469, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:23:57.297893+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0328-s001", "text": "På biblioteket kan du låna böcker på klarspråk som är skrivna på lättläst finska.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0328-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.3316650390625, "generation_seconds": 23.833372303051874, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T04:24:27.314366+00:00 hb-c11-bibliotek tts: PID 140905 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0328-s002", "text": "De är även lämpliga för studier i det finska språket.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-bibliotek/narration/hb-c11-u0328-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.285064697265625, "generation_seconds": 22.457105149980634, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
